WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.248
Googlebot sends no Accept-Language
header and crawls mostly

2
00:00:04.248 --> 00:00:05.501
from US addresses.

3
00:00:05.901 --> 00:00:09.464
Pages chosen by cookie or
header may go unindexed.

4
00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:13.993
General Translation lets the
URL decide the language of every

5
00:00:13.993 --> 00:00:15.594
page you want indexed.

6
00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:18.833
Resolve the URL first,

7
00:00:18.833 --> 00:00:20.365
then the saved cookie,

8
00:00:20.365 --> 00:00:23.232
then Accept-Language,
then the default.

9
00:00:23.632 --> 00:00:26.117
Redirect only at a neutral root,

10
00:00:26.117 --> 00:00:28.856
with a temporary 302 or 307.

11
00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:34.607
In gt-next, createNextMiddleware
checks the URL locale before

12
00:00:34.607 --> 00:00:35.257
the cookie.

13
00:00:35.657 --> 00:00:37.491
With prefixDefaultLocale,

14
00:00:37.491 --> 00:00:41.380
English lives at slash en
and French at slash fr.

15
00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:44.808
Each language now
has an indexable URL.
